@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Field Agent (Android)" as Agent
actor "Admin/User/Visitor (Browser)" as PortalUser

node "Android Device (Offline-First)" {
  component "Android App (Kotlin)" as MobileApp
  database "Local SQLite\n(Offline Cache & LGD)" as LocalDB
}

node "Docker Compose Environment (Ubuntu VM)" {
  component "Nginx Proxy\n(SSL Termination)" as Nginx
  
  component "Web Portal (Vite/React)\n(Admin Dashboard)" as Web
  
  component "Backend API (Node/Express)\n[JWT Auth & 2FA]" as Backend
  
  database "MySQL 8 DB\n(Prisma ORM)" as DB
  folder "Local Storage Volume\n(Uploaded Photos)" as Storage
  component "Docker Daemon\n(Host Socket)" as DockerSock
}

Agent --> MobileApp : Uses
MobileApp <--> LocalDB : Read/Write (Offline)
MobileApp --> Nginx : HTTP/HTTPS (Sync Photos/Data)

PortalUser --> Nginx : HTTPS requests
Nginx --> Web : Serve static assets
Nginx --> Backend : Reverse Proxy API calls

Web --> Backend : HTTP/HTTPS (JWT + 2FA)
Backend --> DB : SQL Queries
Backend --> Storage : Store/Retrieve photos
Backend --> DockerSock : Docker control API (Admin only)

@enduml
